#. Incremento UI: deps intro
msgid "backend_deps_intro"
msgstr "Incremento 使用可选组件进行 PDF OCR 和浏览器扩展同步。基本功能无需这些组件也可使用。"

#. Incremento UI: deps manual install
msgid "backend_deps_manual_install"
msgstr "手动安装：\n    {executable} -m pip install \"{requirement}\""

#. Incremento UI: deps not installed
msgid "backend_deps_not_installed"
msgstr "<span style=\"color: gray; font-size: small;\">尚未安装。点击下方按钮，将其安装到 Incremento 的本地依赖目录。完成后请重启 Anki。</span>"

#. Incremento UI: deps pymupdf
msgid "backend_deps_pymupdf"
msgstr "PyMuPDF（PDF 渲染与文本提取）"

#. Incremento UI: deps pymupdf instructions
msgid "backend_deps_pymupdf_instructions"
msgstr "Incremento 可以将 PyMuPDF 自动安装到其本地依赖目录。\n\n如果未找到兼容的 Python，请从 https://www.python.org/downloads/ 安装带有 pip 的 Python {version}，重启 Anki 后再次点击安装按钮。Python 的版本和处理器架构必须与 Anki 一致。\n\n手动安装：\n    {command}\n\n然后重启 Anki。"

#. Incremento UI: deps restart notice
msgid "backend_deps_restart_notice"
msgstr "PyMuPDF 已安装 — 请重新启动 Anki 后使用。"

#. Incremento UI: deps tesseract
msgid "backend_deps_tesseract"
msgstr "Tesseract OCR（将扫描页转换为可搜索文本）"

#. Incremento UI: deps tesseract linux
msgid "backend_deps_tesseract_linux"
msgstr "使用包管理器安装 Tesseract：\n\n    Ubuntu / Debian:  sudo apt install tesseract-ocr\n    Fedora:           sudo dnf install tesseract\n    Arch:             sudo pacman -S tesseract\n    openSUSE:         sudo zypper install tesseract-ocr\n\n安装后，请重新启动 Anki。"

#. Incremento UI: deps tesseract mac
msgid "backend_deps_tesseract_mac"
msgstr "通过 Homebrew 安装 Tesseract：\n\n    brew install tesseract\n\n没有 Homebrew？请先访问 https://brew.sh 安装。\n\n安装后，请重新启动 Anki。"

#. Incremento UI: deps tesseract windows
msgid "backend_deps_tesseract_windows"
msgstr "下载并运行 Windows 版 Tesseract 安装程序：\n\n    https://github.com/UB-Mannheim/tesseract/wiki\n\n安装时选择 'Add Tesseract to PATH'。\n如果跳过此选项，请安装到默认位置：\n    C:\\Program Files\\Tesseract-OCR\\\n\n安装后，请重新启动 Anki。"

